TI  - Enhancing the hydrolysis and methane production potential of mixed food waste by an effective enzymatic pretreatment
AU  - Uçkun Kiran, Esra
AU  - Trzcinski, Antoine P.
AU  - Liu, Yu
PY  - 2015
JO  - Bioresource Technology
