TI  - Alleviation of propionic acid inhibition and enhancement of methane production in anaerobic digestion by micronano-bubble water supplementation
AU  - Fan, Yujie
AU  - Liu, Yuqi
AU  - Zhang, Ziyang
AU  - Sun, Jinke
AU  - Yang, Xiaojing
AU  - Deng, Peng
